  "worked_solution": "The roots are the solutions to the equation $g(x)=0,$ which we solve as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g(x) & =0 \\\\ \\frac{4}{3}-\\frac{x}{15} & =0 \\\\ \\frac{x}{15} & =\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ x & =\\frac{60}{3} \\\\ x & =20\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function has the single root $x=20.$",
